+// P0-C COMP-2: session trust must NOT auto-approve content-sensitive / G4 gates.
+// Without this carve-out, trust.grant + caution OCR / TinyClick would silently
+// inject under computer.danger_detected / computer.experimental_suggestion
+// (COMP-2 假绿 if only FOREGROUND-YIELD is asserted).
